  web icons draw (client/public/icons, scripts/generate-icons.py). Drawn rather
  than typeset, because the wordmark needs Unbounded and three letters are
  illegible at launcher size anyway.

  108dp viewport with the art inside the central 72dp safe zone, which is what
  every launcher mask is guaranteed not to crop.
-->
